$only — keep selected arrays from the input bundle

SUMMARY
  Copies only the listed arrays from input to output. All other arrays
  are empty in the result.

SYNTAX
  $only(images, prompts)
  $only(texts)
  $only(images, texts, sounds)

INPUT
  Any arrays — only the named arrays are copied through.

OUTPUT
  Same array names as listed in (...); all other arrays empty.

ARGUMENTS
  Positional comma-separated array names: prompts, texts, images, sounds,
  videos, files.

EXAMPLE
  @step: @source -> $only(images, prompts) -> $draw_text

PROMPT-CONSUMING
  No.
